(7081985, 1078064, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of composition. I wonder how this would look without the vignette. It may have less of a focal point, but I wonder if it would be more powerful.</td>', 'Interesting choice of composition. I wonder how this would look without the vignette. It may have less of a focal point, but I wonder if it would be more powerful.', '2013-08-05 18:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
