(7081987, 1078114, 114225, '<td valign="top">A very unexpected photo for this challenge, but I like it. I really like the dead branch coming in, it''s almost like a shot of lighting.</td>', 'A very unexpected photo for this challenge, but I like it. I really like the dead branch coming in, it''s almost like a shot of lighting.', '2013-08-05 18:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
