(7082361, 1078052, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m getting a sense of direct flash on this one. There are some shadows visible on the background. This create a but of a flat scene.</td>', 'I''m getting a sense of direct flash on this one. There are some shadows visible on the background. This create a but of a flat scene.', '2013-08-06 08:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
